{"version":1,"content":"<p>委內瑞拉反對派領袖、諾貝爾和平獎得主馬查多（María Corina Machado）周日（25日）宣布，離國近一年後已返回祖國。</p><p>她在X寫道：「我在這裏，與你們同在。</p><p>」但未交代如何入境及目前位置。</p><p>她回國可能考驗臨時總統羅德里格斯的政治開放，亦令特朗普政府的委內瑞拉策略更複雜。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.202987+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T17:30:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:58:03.728629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536448+00:00","content_hash":"7df023a15106a01fd2c31d80c134184b8bdc878d012bf92c0d7a58841eb5e562","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}